   "subject": "Optional Paths",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is it possible to leave a section of a trajectory optional? I mean, if certain condition applies the activities inside that optional part would be done, otherwise not. Something like using if or ifelse as in regular R code?<div><br></div><div>Currently the only solution I have is via a Branch, but the fact that I have many optional sections makes me define several secondary paths that make the code larger. I wanted to know if there is a simple alternative?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in Advance</div><div><br></div><div>Juan</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
