     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>El martes, 26 de julio de 2016, 23:54:37 (UTC+10), Iñaki Úcar  escribió:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Issue #70 closed. Now, you can use a <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">branch</code> as an <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">if</code>.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SXNzdWUgIzcwIGNsb3NlZC4gTm93LCB5b3UgY2FuIHVzZSBhIGBicmFuY2hgIGFzIGFuIGBpZmAu\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2016-07-23 0:29 GMT+02:00 Iñaki Úcar <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">i.uc...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">See <a href=\"https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/70\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/70&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20D-dY2vPkRYXGAWRfgeJt\">#70</a>. As always, feedback is welcome.</div><div><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2016-07-19 12:01 GMT+02:00 Iñaki Úcar <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">i.uc...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">A branch is your only option. However, if this feature is interesting, we may extend the branch so that selecting the path 0 means continuing to the next activity without entering the branch.</div><div><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2016-07-19 10:54 GMT+02:00 Juan Ossa-Moreno <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">js.os...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Is it possible to leave a section of a trajectory optional? I mean, if certain condition applies the activities inside that optional part would be done, otherwise not. Something like using if or ifelse as in regular R code?<div><br></div><div>Currently the only solution I have is via a Branch, but the fact that I have many optional sections makes me define several secondary paths that make the code larger. I wanted to know if there is a simple alternative?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in Advance</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div>Juan</div></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;simmer-devel&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">simmer-devel...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">simmer...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/simmer-devel/4585deef-f98c-4327-9913-789ef6b52398%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/simmer-devel/4585deef-f98c-4327-9913-789ef6b52398%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LGmQXb_cB7sAZpx57GtCo\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/simmer-devel/4585deef-f98c-4327-9913-789ef6b52398%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2gODYnKPnamd2jIBnE79Cc\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">-- <br><div>Iñaki Úcar<br><a href=\"http://www.enchufa2.es\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.enchufa2.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CgK6Vjisyrpri4jXIi-ek\">http://www.enchufa2.es</a><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/#%21/Enchufa2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/%23%2521/Enchufa2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2E8W5YWIZoCZMTiz1Wz-cG\">@Enchufa2</a><br></div>\r\n</font></span></div>\r\n</blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div>Iñaki Úcar<br><a href=\"http://www.enchufa2.es\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.enchufa2.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CgK6Vjisyrpri4jXIi-ek\">http://www.enchufa2.es</a><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/#%21/Enchufa2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/%23%2521/Enchufa2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2E8W5YWIZoCZMTiz1Wz-cG\">@Enchufa2</a><br></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div>Iñaki Úcar<br><a href=\"http://www.enchufa2.es\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.enchufa2.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CgK6Vjisyrpri4jXIi-ek\">http://www.enchufa2.es</a><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/#%21/Enchufa2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/%23%2521/Enchufa2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963478000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2E8W5YWIZoCZMTiz1Wz-cG\">@Enchufa2</a><br></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>"
