   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Iñaki<div><br></div><div>I tried using the branch with 0 but am getting an error and cannot solve it.</div><div><br></div><div><div>branch(function(attrs) ifelse((PC1S2A_M1 %&gt;% now()) &gt; attrs[[&quot;rest&quot;]],1,0), T,</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> create_trajectory() %&gt;%</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>set_attribute(&quot;stop&quot;,1)</div><div>           )</div><div>am getting</div><div>Error in eval(expr, envir, enclos) : index out of range<br></div><div><br></div><div>I tried using a second branch</div><div><div>branch(function(attrs) ifelse((PC1S2A_M1 %&gt;% now()) &gt; attrs[[&quot;rest&quot;]],1,2), c(T,T),</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> create_trajectory() %&gt;%</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>set_attribute(&quot;stop&quot;,1),</div><div><div>                  create_trajectory(&quot;Alt2&quot;) %&gt;%</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>timeout(0)</div></div><div>           )</div></div><div>and it did work. But I wanted to use the 0 option. Do you have an idea why this may happen?</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards and thanks a lot in advance</div><div><br></div><div>Juan</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>El miércoles, 27 de julio de 2016, 19:03:26 (UTC+10), Iñaki Úcar  escribió:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks for this, I just reinstalled the package. Is there any other way to update the package without reinstalling it?<br></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>No, there isn&#39;t.</div></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div>Iñaki Úcar<br><a href=\"http://www.enchufa2.es\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.enchufa2.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZFdJLMUED1KQ4hCJSOjmV\">http://www.enchufa2.es</a><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/#%21/Enchufa2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/%23%2521/Enchufa2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467963481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3T2D34loFjIxFGsRGWNlTy\">@Enchufa2</a><br></div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>"
