     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, note that this feature is in the GitHub version, whose CRAN release is not scheduled yet. But you can install it with <div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;font-family:monaco,&quot;bitstream vera sans mono&quot;,&quot;lucida console&quot;,terminal,consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,&quot;dejavu sans mono&quot;,&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:12px;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid rgb(229,229,229);overflow-x:auto;background-image:initial;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:rgb(121,93,163)\">devtools</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">::</span>install_github(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>r-simmer/simmer<span>&quot;</span></span>)</pre></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
